        "type": "service",
        "title": "Amazon Data Firehose stream into the lake's landing bucket",
        "description": "A Firehose Direct PUT stream that buffers producers' records under a customer-managed key and writes them into the lake's landing bucket under the pipeline's date prefix, with a delivery role limited to that bucket's delivery and error prefixes and a producer policy limited to this stream.",
        "purpose": "Ingests message feeds into the landing bucket without a Kafka cluster.",
